invariant: INV-11
file: srv_resume.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes
reason: the server resumes a ticket under a suite whose hash is not the
  ticket's, which RFC 9846 §4.7.1 forbids (rfc9846.txt:3219-3220). A
  SHA-384 ticket offered to a handshake that selected a SHA-256 suite is
  then selected, its binder checked with the wrong hash, and the
  handshake ends in decrypt_error where it should have gone on with a
  certificate. The loop's hash mismatch row expects that certificate.

--- old
    return hash_len != 0 && hash_len == sel->hash_len;
--- new
    return hash_len != 0 && sel->hash_len != 0;
